{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Constant action in large city area</h2><br>Fest Guests is an open world survival game about defending yourself against an alien invasion - right at the beginning they ruin your party by abducting all other people!<br><br>First you fight with simple weapons until you get alien technology. The battlefield is the large interactive town area - you can even fight in a robot driven city bus.<br><br>In the beginning you are hunted by aliens - at the end you chase the aliens to the last one!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >In the heat of the battle</h2><br>You find the city is both huge and very interactive - it is full of interiors, shops, restaurants, offices, apartments and other places to visit, hide or fight. Thousands of items to operate, pick up, eat or just throw - with a single mouse click. You can even use an ATM - however, you need no money - you are the only remaining city dweller, or perhaps the only person on Earth.<br><br>You know your hometown - they don't.<br><br><i>The game takes about 5 hours to play, BUT you can and probably want to spend much more time to explore the feature rich city.<i><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968840/extras/868fa8469e70ee5e212b83d774af29eb.avif?t=1720854354\" width=600 height=200 /></span></i></i>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2968840?t=1720854354","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968840/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1720854354","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968840/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1720854354","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968840/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1720854354","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":